s", "Where did she want him?"], [177.6, "q", "Where did she want him?"], [181.9, "a", "Well, she wanted him at the hospital."], [186.4, "s", "At the hospital."], [188.4, "s", "They worked at a hospital."], [193.4, "q", "Did she want him at her house?"], [199.3, "a", "No, no."], [201.8, "q", "Did she want him in New York?"], [207.2, "a", "No, no."], [210.5, "q", "Where did she want him?"], [215.7, "a", "She wanted him in the hospital or at the hospital."], [223.3, "q", "Was he a doctor?"], [227.7, "a", "Yes, that's right."], [229.2, "s", "He was a doctor."], [232.0, "s", "So, she wanted him at the hospital."], [239.1, "s", "How did she want him?"], [243.5, "q", "How did she want him?"], [249.0, "a", "Well, she wanted him romantically, right, with romance."], [256.6, "s", "She wanted Fred romantically."], [262.5, "q", "Did she want Fred to be friends?"], [267.8, "a", "She didn't want to be friends with Fred, no!"], [272.7, "s", "She wanted Fred romantically."], [278.7, "q", "Did she tell Fred her feelings?"], [284.8, "a", "No, she didn't."], [286.9, "s", "She didn't reveal her feelings."], [293.6, "q", "How much did she want Fred romantically?"], [300.9, "a", "Oh, so much."], [304.1, "s", "She wanted Fred romantically more than anything, more than anything."], [316.3, "q", "Where did she want Fred more than anything?"], [323.4, "a", "She wanted Fred at the hospital more than anything."], [330.5, "q", "How did she want him?"], [333.5, "a", "She wanted him romantically."], [338.6, "q", "Did she want him a little bit?"], [343.1, "a", "No!"], [344.8, "s", "She wanted him more than anything."], [349.2, "s", "A lot, a lot, a lot."], [353.1, "q", "Who did she want more than anything?"], [359.0, "a", "Well, of course, Dr. Fred."], [362.0, "s", "She wanted Dr. Fred more than anything."], [367.8, "q", "Where did she want Dr. Fred more than anything?"], [375.3, "a", "At the hospital, right?"], [378.6, "q", "Did she reveal her feelings to Dr. Fred?"], [385.3, "a", "Ah, no, unfortunately no."], [388.6, "s", "She didn't reveal her feelings to Dr. Fred."], [395.3, "s", "How many times did she want Dr. Fred at the hospital?"], [404.4, "q", "How many times?"], [408.1, "a", "A million times."], [411.0, "s", "A million times she wanted Dr. Fred at the hospital."], [416.3, "s", "Every day."], [418.6, "s", "Every hour."], [420.2, "s", "Every minute she thought about him."], [423.1, "s", "She wanted him one million times every day."], [430.9, "s", "She always thought about him."], [436.2, "s", "Why did she want Dr. Fred?"], [441.6, "q", "Why did Alice want Dr. Fred?"], [449.3, "a", "Well, of course."], [451.1, "s", "Because he's rich, right?"], [454.3, "s", "He was rich."], [456.7, "s", "He had a high economic class."], [461.5, "s", "He was rich."], [463.9, "q", "Did she want him because he was wonderful?"], [470.2, "a", "No, no, no."], [472.6, "q", "Did she want him because he was handsome, good-looking?"], [479.8, "a", "No, of course not."], [482.4, "q", "Did she want him because he was kind and sweet and nice?"], [490.6, "a", "Of course not!"], [493.2, "q", "Why did she want Dr. Fred romantically?"], [501.0, "a", "Well, she wanted Dr. Fred romantically because he was rich."], [509.6, "q", "Where did she want him?"], [512.8, "a", "She wanted him at the hospital."], [516.7, "q", "When did she want him?"], [520.2, "a", "She wanted him immediately."], [525.2, "q", "Who did she want immediately?"], [530.8, "a", "Well, she wanted Dr. Fred immediately because he was rich."], [542.5, "q", "Did she have the same religion as Dr. Fred?"], [549.5, "a", "No, she didn't."], [551.3, "s", "Alice didn't have the same religion."], [556.7, "q", "Did they have similar values?"], [561.9, "a", "Yes they did."], [563.8, "s", "What were their similar values?"], [571.0, "q", "What were their similar values?"], [576.9, "a", "Hmm."], [578.8, "s", "Well, of course they both valued money."], [584.0, "s", "They both liked money."], [587.2, "q", "Did Alice like money?"], [590.7, "a", "Yes, of course."], [592.4, "q", "Did Fred like money?"], [596.7, "a", "Yes, of course."], [599.9, "q", "Did they both like money?"], [605.3, "a", "Yes, yes, yes."], [608.5, "q", "Did they both have similar values?"], [614.9, "a", "Yes, they both had similar values, right?"], [620.8, "s", "They both liked money."], [624.1, "s", "So, it's a perfect relationship, right?"], [628.7, "q", "Did she want a deeper relationship with him?"], [635.2, "a", "Yes."], [637.7, "q", "What kind of deeper relationship did she want?"], [646.2, "a", "Well, she wanted to marry him."], [648.7, "s", "She wanted to marry him immediately."], [655.4, "q", "Where did she want to marry him?"], [659.4, "a", "Immediately at the hospital."], [664.2, "s", "She wanted to marry Dr. Fred at the hospital immediately."], [673.2, "q", "Who did she want to marry at the hospital?"], [678.8, "a", "She wanted to marry Dr. Fred at the hospital."], [685.3, "q", "Did she long for Dr. Fred?"], [690.8, "a", "Yes, she did."], [692.9, "s", "How many times every day?"], [697.1, "q", "Did she long for Dr. Fred?"], [702.7, "a", "Well, one million, right?"], [704.8, "s", "One million times."], [706.6, "s", "She longed for Dr. Fred every day."], [712.3, "s", "One million times."], [714.9, "q", "Did Alice reveal her feelings to Dr. Fred?"], [723.7, "a", "No, she didn't."], [727.0, "q", "Did she reveal her longing for Dr. Fred?"], [735.8, "a", "No, she didn't."], [739.1, "q", "Did she tell him where she wanted to marry him?"], [750.1, "a", "No, she didn't."], [753.7, "q", "Who loved Dr. Fred?"], [758.5, "a", "Alice."], [759.3, "s", "Alice loved Dr. Fred."], [765.0, "s", "How did Dr. Fred feel about Alice?"], [772.9, "s", "How did Dr. Fred feel about Alice?"], [780.4, "q", "Did he love Alice?"], [785.3, "a", "No, no, no."], [787.8, "q", "Did he like Alice?"], [792.2, "a", "No, no."], [793.9, "s", "He hated Alice."], [795.6, "s", "He hated Alice."], [799.2, "q", "Did Alice love Fred?"], [802.8, "a", "Yes, of course."], [804.0, "s", "Alice loved Fred."], [806.3, "q", "Did Dr. Fred love Alice?"], [811.0, "a", "No, he hated Alice."], [815.7, "q", "When did he hate Alice?"], [819.5, "a", "He hated Alice always, all the time."], [824.3, "s", "He always hated Alice."], [828.0, "q", "How much did he hate Alice?"], [833.2, "a", "Oh, super a lot."], [836.1, "s", "He hated her a lot."], [838.7, "s", "He hated her all the time."], [842.7, "q", "Who did Dr. Fred hate?"], [847.2, "a", "Well, he hated Alice."], [850.0, "q", "Why did he hate Alice?"], [853.9, "a", "Well, of course, Alice wanted his money, right?"], [860.2, "s", "Alice wanted Dr. Fred's money, so he hated Alice."], [867.2, "q", "Did he hate her a little bit?"], [872.7, "a", "No, he hated her a lot."], [877.4, "q", "Did he always hate her?"], [881.3, "a", "Yes, he always hated her."], [885.2, "q", "And why did he always hate her a lot?"], [892.3, "a", "Well, Fred always hated her a lot because Alice wanted his money."], [903.8, "s", "Okay, the end."], [906.7, "s", "Please listen to this many times every day."], [911.4, "s", "Answer every question."], [913.8, "s", "Pause, answer the question, then play."], [917.9, "s", "Pause, answer the next question, then play."], [922.1, "s", "Okay, see you next time."], [923.6, "s", "Bye-bye."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
